{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dante's 9 is a roguelite action-platformer fused with a deckbuilder, where you use powerful cards to augment your combat abilities. Customize and upgrade your cards to battle through the depths of the underworld as Dante the cat. Can you reach the 9th circle before its too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/7c2e8210f3754c311ef88bcbb3f64ee7.poster.avif?t=1764382389\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/7c2e8210f3754c311ef88bcbb3f64ee7.webm?t=1764382389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/7c2e8210f3754c311ef88bcbb3f64ee7.mp4?t=1764382389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a uniquely powerful deck each run to slay the monsters of the underworld!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/522982b83464117af5afca66860bba76.poster.avif?t=1764382389\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/522982b83464117af5afca66860bba76.webm?t=1764382389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/522982b83464117af5afca66860bba76.mp4?t=1764382389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the nine circles of Hell with real-time card-based combat, combined with action platforming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/3ae944a1205f08fd4d852e7d0fbeabe0.poster.avif?t=1764382389\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/3ae944a1205f08fd4d852e7d0fbeabe0.webm?t=1764382389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/3ae944a1205f08fd4d852e7d0fbeabe0.mp4?t=1764382389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse nine hellish environments and conquer unique challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable cards with unique sticker system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ulockable cat styles to change your experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable pins that augment your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable decks that alter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Unique biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow button</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293350?t=1764382389","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293350?t=1764382389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/097504b8eaaef66e47461ca5bab2f4f2629ac6cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764382389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/